{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"16907fe07c4bb266d28d66d5996b9f9dfe9a0d925dbb68ba0e09c89b36b5cb0d","digest":{"component_or_area":"test infrastructure / conftest fixture","key_entities":["_rebar_repo_template","tests/interfaces/conftest.py","tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_template_stays_virgin","rebar.list_tickets()","rebar.init_repo()","REBAR_ROOT","MonkeyPatch.context()",".rebar",".tickets-tracker"],"problem_keywords":["fixture assertion","template virginity","test isolation","ticket seeding","rebar initialization"],"propositions":["The template fixture _rebar_repo_template asserts .rebar absence but omits assertion that no tickets are pre-seeded into the template.","Narrowed test runs (e.g. pytest tests/interfaces/store) skip the test-level template virginity check, leaving the no-tickets invariant unprotected.","The tickets assertion must execute inside MonkeyPatch.context() where REBAR_ROOT and cwd are pinned, so rebar.list_tickets() can query the template store.","Adding rebar.list_tickets() == [] assertion inside the MonkeyPatch context block closes the gap and enforces the invariant at construction time before any test runs."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787550270122361001,"uuid":"9b98bfd5-ece8-42b2-8fc1-4b81aa711d22"}